	(text "J13 1 <- Pi GPIO14 TXD\nJ13 2 -> Pi GPIO15 RXD\nJ13 3 = GND (Pi header pin 6); 3.3 V logic\nR12/R13 near U1 (no ESD array fitted)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 53.09 90.93 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "89fb007c-a8eb-4e8e-99cc-4643e6d017b4")
	)
	(text "Raspberry Pi 5 link (USART2, PA2 TX / PA3 RX), Pi 3V3 sense, STM32 reset and BOOT0"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.26 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8fd6df59-fc95-4110-84de-b8bc968f8d06")
	)
	(text "Bring-up: leave J14 unwired, check TP1; load-test J14;\nthen connect the Pi. 5-6 A path"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.53 135.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d11d4de4-ad57-4728-91e6-e410ca3df342")
	)
	(text "Pi 5 power: +5V_PI -> J14 USB-C pigtail (no fuse: U2's current limit and hiccup protect it)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.53 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ec193a06-11ca-405a-81f2-2e5d6594350f")
	)
	(text "Pi-controlled functions (J13 4 <- Pi 3V3 pin 1, 5 <- GPIO23 pin 16, 6 <- GPIO24 pin 18)\nAUX_EN: the +5V_AUX buck (U5) runs only while the Pi's 3V3 is up.\nPI_RESET + PI_BOOT0 -> reflash the STM32 from the Pi over USART2 (AN2606:\nPA2/PA3 is a bootloader port on STM32F09x). Sequence: BOOT0 high, pulse reset,\nrun stm32flash at 115200 8E1, then BOOT0 low and reset.\nAt Pi boot GPIO23/24 default to pull-down inputs, so the STM32 runs normally."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f3c96de3-7230-415b-ae69-4d801602c3de")
	)
