		(property "Description" "Series 1k on UART TX (PA2 USART2_TX -> Pi RXD). Limits injection into PA2/PA3 (TTa, 5 mA max) if either side is unpowered, and stops the STM32 back-powering the Pi. Place near U1."
			(at 81.28 62.23 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
