		(property "Description" "Link to the Raspberry Pi 5 GPIO header, JST XH 2.5 mm side-entry (XHP-6 housing): 1 = PI_TXD from Pi GPIO14 TXD (pin 8); 2 = PI_RXD to Pi GPIO15 RXD (pin 10); 3 = GND (pin 6); 4 = PI_3V3 from Pi 3V3 (pin 1), sense only; 5 = PI_RESET from Pi GPIO23 (pin 16), high resets the STM32; 6 = PI_BOOT0 from Pi GPIO24 (pin 18), high selects the ROM bootloader. 3.3 V logic."
			(at 91.44 77.47 0)
